    "check": "Width and depth change actual geometry to 140x80x40 mm; the 3 mm floor/walls remain. On the measured Fusion build the face-positioned vent seed follows the face centre: widening by 20 mm shifts the whole grid by +10 mm in x. Revised x centres are 30,50,70,90,110 mm; y remains 20,40,60 mm. The grid stays centred, with unchanged 20 mm spacing."
  },
  "limits": [
    "Use a new empty parametric document; parameter names must be unique in that document.",
    "Shell thickness and pattern spacing are numeric feature inputs here; the guide does not claim parameter bindings for them.",
    "This is a modelling lesson, not a strength, thermal or fabrication-clearance certification."
  ],
  "teaching": [
    "Constrain the footprint before downstream features. A coordinate alone is not a design constraint.",
    "Bind the extrusion expression to the named parameter before shelling.",
    "Drill the stable exterior bottom face (-z), not the top rim of an open shell.",
    "Pattern the feature via @vent.feature; a pattern alias refers to its feature.",
    "A hole position is evaluated on its support face. Verify downstream positions after resizing: this width revision shifts the vent grid with the face centre, despite the footprint remaining anchored.",
    "Validate each revision with geometry and re-open the exported archive."
  ],
  "exports": [
    {
      "name": "fu_export",
      "args": {
        "format": "step",
        "out": "/absolute/output/enclosure.step"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "fu_export",
      "args": {
        "format": "f3d",
        "out": "/absolute/output/enclosure.f3d"
      }
    }
  ]
